export const accessibilityMarkdown = `_Last updated: August 27, 2026_

Career Source Group, LLC ("Career Source Group," "we," "us") wants this website to be usable by
everyone, including people who use assistive technology such as screen readers, voice control, or
keyboard-only navigation.

## Our approach

We build and test this site against the [Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.1](https://www.w3.org/TR/WCAG21/)
Level AA success criteria. In practice that means: visible keyboard focus on every interactive
element, form fields with persistent labels and programmatic error messages, sufficient color
contrast, meaningful alternative text on images, and layouts that work with a keyboard alone or a
screen reader. We test this as part of our regular development process, not as a one-time check.

## Ongoing work

Accessibility is an ongoing effort rather than a fixed state. As we add or change pages, we review
them against the same standard, but we don't claim the site is perfect or fully conformant at every
moment in time.

## Let us know if something doesn't work

If you use assistive technology and run into a barrier anywhere on this site — a control you can't
reach, text you can't read, or a form you can't complete — please tell us through our
[Contact page](/contact). Include the page and what happened, and we'll look into it.

## Questions

Questions about this statement can be sent through our [Contact page](/contact).`;

